    "author": "관리자",
    "date": "2025-06-10",
    "url": "https://www.prok.org/Board/Detail/31414/116118?page=3",
    "content": "<div class=\"detail-content\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font size=\"3\"><b>제110회 총회 선거 후보자 등록 접수</b></font></div><div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span 0pt;=\"\" 11pt;\"=\"\" 34);=\"\" 34,=\"\" color:=\"\" font-size:=\"\" kopubworld바탕체=\"\" lang=\"EN-US\" letter-spacing:=\"\" medium\";=\"\" rgb(34,=\"\" style=\"font-family: \"><br/></span></div><div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span 0pt;=\"\" 11pt;\"=\"\" 34);=\"\" 34,=\"\" color:=\"\" font-size:=\"\" kopubworld바탕체=\"\" lang=\"EN-US\" letter-spacing:=\"\" medium\";=\"\" rgb(34,=\"\" style=\"font-family: \">제110회 총회 에서는 </span></div><div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span 0pt;=\"\" 11pt;\"=\"\" 34);=\"\" 34,=\"\" color:=\"\" font-size:=\"\" kopubworld바탕체=\"\" lang=\"EN-US\" letter-spacing:=\"\" medium\";=\"\" rgb(34,=\"\" style=\"font-family: \">총회장, 부총회장(목사 1인, 장로 1인)을 선출합니다.</span></div><div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span 0pt;=\"\" 11pt;\"=\"\" 34);=\"\" 34,=\"\" color:=\"\" font-size:=\"\" kopubworld바탕체=\"\" lang=\"EN-US\" letter-spacing:=\"\" medium\";=\"\" rgb(34,=\"\" style=\"font-family: \">선거 후보 등록 접수 첫날 </span></div><div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span 0pt;=\"\" 11pt;\"=\"\" 34);=\"\" 34,=\"\" color:=\"\" font-size:=\"\" kopubworld바탕체=\"\" lang=\"EN-US\" letter-spacing:=\"\" medium\";=\"\" rgb(34,=\"\" style=\"font-family: \">각 노회에서 추천을 받은 3분이 </span></div><div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span 0pt;=\"\" 11pt;\"=\"\" 34);=\"\" 34,=\"\" color:=\"\" font-size:=\"\" kopubworld바탕체=\"\" lang=\"EN-US\" letter-spacing:=\"\" medium\";=\"\" rgb(34,=\"\" style=\"font-family: \">서류 접수를 위해 총회를 방문하셨습니다.</span></div><div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font color=\"#222222\" face=\"KoPubWorld바탕체 Medium\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 14.6667px;\"><br/></span></font></div><div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font color=\"#222222\" face=\"KoPubWorld바탕체 Medium\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 14.6667px;\">이후 선거관리위원회는 </span></font></div><div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font color=\"#222222\" face=\"KoPubWorld바탕체 Medium\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 14.6667px;\">각 후보들이 제출한 서류를 점검하고, </span></font></div><div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font color=\"#222222\" face=\"KoPubWorld바탕체 Medium\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 14.6667px;\">7월 1일(화) 후보자들을 면담하여</span></font></div><div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font color=\"#222222\" face=\"KoPubWorld바탕체 Medium\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 14.6667px;\">등록 공고를 할 예정입니다.</span></font></div><div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font color=\"#222222\" face=\"KoPubWorld바탕체 Medium\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 14.6667px;\"><br/></span></font></div><div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span 0pt;=\"\" 11pt;\"=\"\" 34);=\"\" 34,=\"\" color:=\"\" font-size:=\"\" kopubworld바탕체=\"\" lang=\"EN-US\" letter-spacing:=\"\" medium\";=\"\" rgb(34,=\"\" style=\"font-family: \">공정하고 </span></div><div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span 0pt;=\"\" 11pt;\"=\"\" 34);=\"\" 34,=\"\" color:=\"\" font-size:=\"\" kopubworld바탕체=\"\" lang=\"EN-US\" letter-spacing:=\"\" medium\";=\"\" rgb(34,=\"\" style=\"font-family: \">교단의 지도력이 세워지는 </span></div><div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span 0pt;=\"\" 11pt;\"=\"\" 34);=\"\" 34,=\"\" color:=\"\" font-size:=\"\" kopubworld바탕체=\"\" lang=\"EN-US\" letter-spacing:=\"\" medium\";=\"\" rgb(34,=\"\" style=\"font-family: \">선거가 될 수 있도록 </span></div><div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span 0pt;=\"\" 11pt;\"=\"\" 34);=\"\" 34,=\"\" color:=\"\" font-size:=\"\" kopubworld바탕체=\"\" lang=\"EN-US\" letter-spacing:=\"\" medium\";=\"\" rgb(34,=\"\" style=\"font-family: \">계속하여 기도해 주십시오.  </span></div><div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span 0pt;=\"\" 11pt;\"=\"\" 34);=\"\" 34,=\"\" color:=\"\" font-size:=\"\" kopubworld바탕체=\"\" lang=\"EN-US\" letter-spacing:=\"\" medium\";=\"\" rgb(34,=\"\" style=\"font-family: \"><br/></span></div><div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span 0pt;=\"\" 11pt;\"=\"\" 34);=\"\" 34,=\"\" color:=\"\" font-size:=\"\" kopubworld바탕체=\"\" lang=\"EN-US\" letter-spacing:=\"\" medium\";=\"\" rgb(34,=\"\" style=\"font-family: \"><img align=\"\" src=\"https://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2506/764337996_d00b9817_1091EC84A0EAB1B01EB93B1EBA19D1ECA091EC88985.jpg\"/><br/><br/></span></div><div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span 0pt;=\"\" 11pt;\"=\"\" 34);=\"\" 34,=\"\" color:=\"\" font-size:=\"\" kopubworld바탕체=\"\" lang=\"EN-US\" letter-spacing:=\"\" medium\";=\"\" rgb(34,=\"\" style=\"font-family: \"><img align=\"\" src=\"https://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2506/764337996_847c1f75_1091EC84A0EAB1B01EB93B1EBA19D1ECA091EC88986.jpg\"/><br/><br/></span></div>\n</div>"
