    "url": "https://www.prok.org/Board/Detail/31414/116031?page=3",
    "content": "<div class=\"detail-content\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"3\"><b>총회 임원과 남신도회전국연합회 임원 간담회</b></font></div><div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"3\"><br/></font></div><div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"3\">4월 15일(화) 오후 1시, 총회본부 대회의실에서 </font></div><div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"3\">총회 임원과 남신도회전국연합회 임원 간담회가 있었습니다.</font></div><div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"3\"><br/></font></div><div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"3\">총회 임원들과 남신도회전국연합회 임원들께서</font></div><div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"3\">서로 인사를 나누며</font></div><div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"3\">교단과 교회를 위해 </font></div><div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><div style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">더욱 맡겨진 사명을 잘 감당할 것을</font></div><div style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: medium;\">약속하며 다짐하는 귀한 시간이었습니다.</span></div></div><div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"3\"><br/></font></div><div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"3\">물심양면으로 헌신하며 섬기는</font></div><div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"3\">남신도회전국연합회 임원들을 위해</font></div><div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"3\">계속 기도하며 응원해 주시길 바랍니다.</font></div><div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"3\"><br/></font></div><div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><img align=\"\" src=\"https://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2504/764337996_3efd2024_EB82A8EC8BA0EB8F84ED9A8C158ED9A8C1EC9E84EC9B901EBB0A9EBACB87ECA084ECB2B4.jpg\"/><br/></div><div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"3\"><br/></font></div><div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><img align=\"\" src=\"https://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2504/764337996_494d6c3c_EB82A8EC8BA0EB8F84ED9A8C158ED9A8C1EC9E84EC9B901EBB0A9EBACB81ECB49DED9A8CEC9EA5.jpg\"/><br/></div><div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"3\"><br/></font></div><div style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><img align=\"\" src=\"https://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2504/764337996_8570c8dd_EB82A8EC8BA0EB8F84ED9A8C158ED9A8C1EC9E84EC9B901EBB0A9EBACB81EB8BA8ECB2B4.jpg\"/><br/><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"3\"></font></div>\n</div>"
