    "content": "<div class=\"detail-content\">\n<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-5d4a9b19-7fff-fc10-228d-71ed1263b700\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">5.18 광주민주화운동 44주년 기념예배</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> </span></p><br/><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">전상건 총회장은 2024년 5월 18일(토) 오후 2시 광주한빛교회당에서 열린</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">광주민주화운동 44주년 기념예배에 참석하고 기념사를 하셨습니다. </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">광주. 전남 지역의 목사님과 교우들, 기장 남신도회와 여신도회, 기장 전국장로회 및 전국 여러 곳에서 </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">많은 분들이 </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">기념예배에 참석하여 희생과 감사와 결단을 나눈 시간이었습니다 </span></p><div><span><br/></span></div><br/></span><div><img align=\"\" src=\"https://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2405/2080742328_66f942b6_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05D20240518_518EC9888EBB0B0128829.jpg\"/><br/></div><div><span><br/></span></div><div><img align=\"\" src=\"https://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2405/2080742328_88d62ab2_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05D20240518_518EC9888EBB0B0128929.jpg\"/><br/><span></span></div><div><br/></div><div><img align=\"\" src=\"https://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2405/2080742328_2d3df127_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05D20240518_518EC9888EBB0B01281129.jpg\"/><br/><br/></div><div><img align=\"\" src=\"https://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2405/2080742328_05c42479_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05D20240518_518EC9888EBB0B028ECB49DEBACB4128129.jpg\"/><br/><br/></div><div><br/></div><br>\n<br>\n[이 게시물은 관리자님에 의해 2024-10-02 18:36:10 총회장 동정에서 이동 됨]\r\n\r\n\r\n        </br></br></div>"
