    "content": "<div class=\"detail-content\">\n<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-74b63c0d-7fff-b375-fe06-c2b9c317691c\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.656;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">제108회 총회 임원회</span></p><br/><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.656;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">2024년 5월 10일, 온양장로교회에서</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.656;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">제108회 총회 임원회 6차 회의가 있었습니다. </span></p><br/><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.656;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">실행위원회 안건과 제109회 총회 준비 등을 의논하였습니다.</span></p><div><span><br/></span></div><div><br/></div><img align=\"\" src=\"https://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2405/764337996_9201ba9d_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05D20240509EC9E84EC9B90ED9A8C128329.jpg\"/><br/><br/></span><div></div><div><img align=\"\" src=\"https://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2405/764337996_30383fbe_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05D20240509EC9E84EC9B90ED9A8C128229.jpg\"/><br/><span></span></div><div><br/></div><div><img align=\"\" src=\"https://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2405/764337996_2b4391b0_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05D20240509EC9E84EC9B90ED9A8C128729.jpg\"/><br/><br/></div><div><img align=\"\" src=\"https://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2405/764337996_24cd55f4_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05D20240509EC9E84EC9B90ED9A8C128929.jpg\"/><br/><br/></div><br>\n<br>\n[이 게시물은 관리자님에 의해 2024-10-02 18:35:50 총회장 동정에서 이동 됨]\r\n\r\n\r\n        </br></br></div>"
