    "title": "[총회장 동정 80] 한신상 수상자 애광원 김임순 장로님과의 만찬",
    "author": "전상건",
    "date": "2024-04-26",
    "url": "https://www.prok.org/Board/Detail/1674/157309?page=3",
    "content": "<div class=\"detail-content\">\n<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-5caf4a5e-7fff-0306-cba5-4a184c0c56d1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.56;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">한신상 수상자 애광원 김임순 장로님과의 만찬</span></p><br/><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">한신대학교(총장 강성영)는 제29회 한신상 수상자로 김임순 거제도애광원장을 선정하였습니다. </span></p><br/><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">한신대학교는 4월 25일(목) 한신대 신대원에서  한신상 수상자 애광원 김임순 장로님과의 만찬을 열었습니다. </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">전상건 총회장님 참석하시어 만찬기도를 하시고, 축하의 시간을 보냈습니다.</span></p><br/><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">제29회 한신상 시상식은 4월 26일(금) ‘한신대학교 개교84주년 기념예식’에서 진행할 예정입니다.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br/></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2404/764337996_588a98ec_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05D20240425ED959CEC8BA0EC8381EBA78CECB0AC28ECB49DED9A8CEC9EA5128229.jpg\"/><br/><br>\n</br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2404/764337996_5be134cc_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05D20240425ED959CEC8BA0EC8381EBA78CECB0AC28ECB49DED9A8CEC9EA5128429.jpg\"/><br/><br/></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2404/764337996_b6e8f2db_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05D20240425ED959CEC8BA0EC8381EBA78CECB0AC28ECB49DED9A8CEC9EA5128529.jpg\"/><br/><br>\n<img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2404/764337996_9fa0f8bf_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05D20240425ED959CEC8BA0EC8381EBA78CECB0AC28ECB49DED9A8CEC9EA5128129.jpg\"/><br/><br>\n<br>\n</br></br></br></span></p></span><br>\n<br>\n[이 게시물은 관리자님에 의해 2024-10-02 18:35:50 총회장 동정에서 이동 됨]\r\n\r\n\r\n        </br></br></div>"
