    "content": "<div class=\"detail-content\">\n<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-51c993b2-7fff-8295-5a55-18805ea927fe\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">총회 본부와 한기장복지재단 임명장 수여</span></p><br/><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">인사위원회는 9월 1일자로 선교사업국 인사행정부 이은정 목사, 국내선교부 박의배 목사를 부장으로, 재단재정부 김수용 씨를 간사로 발령하였습니다. 한기장복지재단의 김승종 목사를 국장으로 김영란 씨를 과장으로 재임용하고, 장기근속자 곽진숙 씨에게 포상을 하였습니다.</span></p><br/><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">총회장님은 각각 임명장을 수여해 주신 후, 직원들을 축복해 주시고 우리 총회본부와 한기장복지재단이 더욱 성숙하고 발전되기를 기원해 주셨습니다. </span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br/></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2309/764337996_a09f3b99_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05DKakaoTalk_20230914_101911896.jpg\"/> <img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2309/764337996_ecf5d26f_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05DKakaoTalk_20230914_101911896_01.jpg\"/> <img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2309/764337996_4e54eda5_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05DKakaoTalk_20230914_101911896_02.jpg\"/><br/><br>\n<img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2309/764337996_3be6eab1_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05DKakaoTalk_20230914_101911896_03.jpg\"/> <img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2309/764337996_f0eb04f1_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05DKakaoTalk_20230914_101911896_04.jpg\"/> <img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2309/764337996_afe330c4_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05DKakaoTalk_20230914_101911896_05.jpg\"/><br/><br>\n<img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2309/764337996_80f5be9e_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05DKakaoTalk_20230914_101911896_06.jpg\"/> <img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2309/764337996_05c74b9a_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05DKakaoTalk_20230914_101911896_07.jpg\"/> <img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2309/764337996_77c425fd_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05DKakaoTalk_20230914_101911896_08.jpg\"/><br/><br>\n<img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2309/764337996_909e9cd7_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05DKakaoTalk_20230914_101911896_09.jpg\"/> <img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2309/764337996_7b7f9c4e_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05DKakaoTalk_20230914_101911896_10.jpg\"/> <img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2309/764337996_8538313b_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05DKakaoTalk_20230914_101911896_11.jpg\"/><br/><br>\n<img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2309/764337996_66c9abb1_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05DKakaoTalk_20230914_101911896_12.jpg\"/> <img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2309/764337996_09ddc7b0_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05DKakaoTalk_20230914_101911896_13.jpg\"/> <img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2309/764337996_6c40b6c2_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05DKakaoTalk_20230914_101911896_14.jpg\"/><br/><br>\n<img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2309/764337996_6f4af170_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05DKakaoTalk_20230914_101911896_15.jpg\"/> <img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2309/764337996_01726e08_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05DKakaoTalk_20230914_101911896_16.jpg\"/> <img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2309/764337996_e5488ab3_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05DKakaoTalk_20230914_101911896_17.jpg\"/><br/><br>\n<img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2309/764337996_87d13460_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05DKakaoTalk_20230914_101911896_18.jpg\"/><br/><br>\n</br></br></br></br></br></br></br></span></div></span> <br>\n[이 게시물은 관리자님에 의해 2023-09-26 18:08:18 총회장 동정에서 이동 됨]\r\n\r\n\r\n        </br></div>"
