    "content": "<div class=\"detail-content\">\n<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-696a6fd8-7fff-5042-6544-24d382f43d05\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">NCCK 총무취임 감사예배</span></p><br/><br/><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">한국기독교교회협의회(NCCK)는 8월 17일(목) 오후 2시에 한국기독교연합회관 3층에서 </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">김종생 목사 총무취임 감사예배를 드렸습니다.</span></p><br/><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">강연홍 총회장(NCCK 회장)께서 “모세가 구하여 이르되”(출 32:7-14)라는 주제로 </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">말씀 선포하시고 격려해 주셨습니다. </span></p><br/><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">한국기독교교회협의회가 사회와 역사 속에서 교회의 사명을 온전히 감당할 수 있도록 기도합니다.</span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br/></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br/></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2308/764337996_2f8941e0_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05D20230817NCCKECB49DEBACB4ECB7A8EC9E84128129.jpg\"/><br/><br>\n</br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2308/764337996_c7848df8_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05D20230817NCCKECB49DEBACB4ECB7A8EC9E84128229.jpg\"/> <img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2308/764337996_337f1739_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05D20230817NCCKECB49DEBACB4ECB7A8EC9E84128329.jpg\"/><br/><br>\n<img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2308/764337996_4e5a9731_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05D20230817NCCKECB49DEBACB4ECB7A8EC9E84128429.jpg\"/><br/><br>\n<img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2308/764337996_2a4063bd_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05D20230817NCCKECB49DEBACB4ECB7A8EC9E84128629.jpg\"/><br/><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-a4779ef9-7fff-6613-7641-cb6878c942eb\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">(김종생 총무)</span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2308/764337996_5c4fbac0_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05D20230817NCCKECB49DEBACB4ECB7A8EC9E84128729.jpg\"/><br/></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br/></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2308/764337996_518185db_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05D20230817NCCKECB49DEBACB4ECB7A8EC9E84128829.jpg\"/><br/></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br/></span></div></span></br></br></span></div></span> <br>\n[이 게시물은 관리자님에 의해 2023-09-26 18:08:18 총회장 동정에서 이동 됨]\r\n\r\n\r\n        </br></div>"
