    "title": "[총회장 동정 131] 제47회 남신도회 전국대회",
    "author": "강연홍",
    "date": "2023-07-18",
    "url": "https://www.prok.org/Board/Detail/1673/156614?page=2",
    "content": "<div class=\"detail-content\">\n<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-d1087733-7fff-fa7c-c8c7-a50ea1c58fa5\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.656;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">제47회 남신도회 전국대회</span></p><br/><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:2.16;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">“주의 사랑으로 우리를 구하소서!”라는 주제로</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:2.16;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">2023년 7월 18일(화)부터  20일(목)까지 2박 3일간 웰리힐리파크(강원도 횡성)에서 열리는</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:2.16;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">제47회 남신도회 전국대회에서 강연홍 총회장님 시작하는 예배 설교말씀 전하셨습니다.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:2.16;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><br/></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:2.16;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">하나님의 크신 은혜가 남신도회에 늘 충만하시길 소망합니다.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:2.16;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br/></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:2.16;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2307/764337996_204e7851_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05D20230718EB82A8EC8BA0EB8F84ED9A8C128129.jpg\"/> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:2.16;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2307/764337996_c8ce7e30_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05D20230718EB82A8EC8BA0EB8F84ED9A8C128229.jpg\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"/><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:2.16;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2307/764337996_21d4a966_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05D20230718EB82A8EC8BA0EB8F84ED9A8C128429.jpg\"/>     <br/></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:2.16;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2307/764337996_fcfd064b_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05D20230718EB82A8EC8BA0EB8F84ED9A8C128529.jpg\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"/></p></span> <br>\n[이 게시물은 관리자님에 의해 2023-09-26 18:08:18 총회장 동정에서 이동 됨]\r\n\r\n\r\n        </br></div>"
