    "content": "<div class=\"detail-content\">\n<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-bc51f6ea-7fff-100c-1659-81186c978976\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">한국기독교교회협의회 인선위원회 </span></p><br/><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">한국기독교교회협의회의 새로운 총무를 인선하는 인선위원회가 모였습니다. </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">전 총무의 사임으로 전총무 임기 중에 잔여임기를 섬길 분을 인선위원회가 실행위원회에 추천하는 과정입니다.</span></p><br/><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">한국기독교교회협의회 회원교단 교단장과 총무들이 조찬 모임 후 인선위원회를 열어서 인선을 은혜 가운데 마쳤습니다. </span></p><br/><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">실행위원회에 추천된 분의 앞으로 절차가 잘 진행되고 난제가 많은 한국기독교교회협의회를 잘 이끌어 주시기를 기도드립니다.</span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br/></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br/></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2307/2080742328_9fb88991_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05DKakaoTalk_20230715_102103052.jpg\"/><br/><br>\n</br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2307/2080742328_cd8b7493_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05DKakaoTalk_20230715_102103052_04.jpg\"/><br/><br>\n</br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2307/2080742328_62882354_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05DKakaoTalk_20230715_102103052_05.jpg\"/><br/><br>\n</br></span></div></span> <br>\n[이 게시물은 관리자님에 의해 2023-09-26 18:08:18 총회장 동정에서 이동 됨]\r\n\r\n\r\n        </br></div>"
