    "title": "[총회장 동정 127] 제15회 한국장로교의 날",
    "author": "강연홍",
    "date": "2023-07-10",
    "url": "https://www.prok.org/Board/Detail/1673/156581?page=2",
    "content": "<div class=\"detail-content\">\n<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-bdb4bf58-7fff-8871-67af-6a1651db472e\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">제15회 한국장로교의 날</span></p><br/><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">한국장로교총연합회는 2023년 7월 10일(월) 오후2시 연동교회에서 </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">‘다시 일어서는 장로교회’라는 주제로 제15회 한국장로교의 날 행사를 개최하였습니다. </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">우리 교단을 포함하여 25개 교단이 함께 모여 예배와 성찬식, </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">자랑스러운 장로교인상 시상식과 비전선언를 하였습니다.</span></p><br/><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">자랑스러운 장로교인상은 목회, 교육, 선교, 복지 부문과 특별상으로 나누어 수상하며, </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">복지부문 수상자는 우리 교단에서 1952년부터 현재까지 70년 7개월을 </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">전쟁고아와 중증장애인을 위해 헌신하신 애광원 김임순 원장님이 수상하셨습니다. </span></p><br/><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">강연홍 총회장님과 총회 임원들도 함께 참여하여 축하드렸습니다.</span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br/></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br/></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2307/764337996_03f09a27_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05D20230710EC9EA5EBA19CEAB590EC9D98EB82A01281129.jpg\"/><br/><br>\n</br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2307/764337996_6c770e37_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05D20230710EC9EA5EBA19CEAB590EC9D98EB82A01281429-1.jpg\"/><br/><br>\n</br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2307/764337996_c9841140_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05D20230710171359.jpg\"/><br/><br>\n</br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> </span><img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2307/764337996_8f127465_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05D20230710EC9EA5EBA19CEAB590EC9D98EB82A01283129.jpg\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"/> <img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2307/764337996_d807da18_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05D20230710EC9EA5EBA19CEAB590EC9D98EB82A01282329.jpg\" style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"/></div><div><br/></div><div><img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2307/764337996_5c716962_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05D20230710EC9EA5EBA19CEAB590EC9D98EB82A01283229.jpg\"/><br/></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br>\n<img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2307/764337996_dd19bb36_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05D20230710EC9EA5EBA19CEAB590EC9D98EB82A01283729.jpg\"/><br/><br>\n<img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2307/764337996_8b26356e_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05D20230710EC9EA5EBA19CEAB590EC9D98EB82A01283829.jpg\"/><br/><br>\n<img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2307/764337996_c415f291_5BEABEB8EBAFB8EAB8B05D20230710EC9EA5EBA19CEAB590EC9D98EB82A01284729.jpg\"/><br/><br>\n<br>\n</br></br></br></br></br></span></div><div></div></span> <br>\n[이 게시물은 관리자님에 의해 2023-09-26 18:08:18 총회장 동정에서 이동 됨]\r\n\r\n\r\n        </br></div>"
