    "url": "https://www.prok.org/Board/Detail/1673/156565?page=3",
    "content": "<div class=\"detail-content\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Tahoma, 굴림; font-size: 9pt; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">2023 총회 신도정책협의회</span></p><br style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"/><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Tahoma, 굴림; font-size: 9pt; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">2023년 6월 29일(목) 14:30~19:30까지 한신교회에서 </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Tahoma, 굴림; font-size: 9pt; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">2023 총회 신도정책협의회를 개최했습니다.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Tahoma, 굴림; font-size: 9pt; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span 0pt;=\"\" bold;\"=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" kopubworld바탕체=\"\" lang=\"EN-US\" letter-spacing:=\"\" light\";=\"\" style=\"font-size: medium; font-family: \"><br/></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Tahoma, 굴림; font-size: 9pt; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span 0pt;=\"\" bold;\"=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" kopubworld바탕체=\"\" lang=\"EN-US\" letter-spacing:=\"\" light\";=\"\" style=\"font-size: medium; font-family: \">“</span><span bold;\"=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" kopubworld바탕체=\"\" light\";=\"\" style=\"font-size: medium; font-family: \">문화는 오늘의 것으로</span><span 0pt;=\"\" bold;\"=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" kopubworld바탕체=\"\" lang=\"EN-US\" letter-spacing:=\"\" light\";=\"\" style=\"font-size: medium; font-family: \">, </span><span bold;\"=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" kopubworld바탕체=\"\" light\";=\"\" style=\"font-size: medium; font-family: \">메시지는 영원한 진리로</span><span 0pt;=\"\" bold;\"=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" kopubworld바탕체=\"\" lang=\"EN-US\" letter-spacing:=\"\" light\";=\"\" style=\"font-size: medium; font-family: \">”</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Tahoma, 굴림; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br/></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Tahoma, 굴림; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">금번 개최된 신도정책협의회의 주제입니다.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Tahoma, 굴림; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br/></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><font color=\"#222222\" face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">목회데이터연구소 지용근 대표님을 통해 </span></font></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><font color=\"#222222\" face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">2023년 교회 트렌드와 각 세대별 대응방안에 대해 데이터를 통해 살펴보았고,</span></font></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><font color=\"#222222\" face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">저녁시간에는 이선영 목사님과 김정현 청년을 통해 청년들이 교회를 떠나는 이유와</span></font></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><font color=\"#222222\" face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">대책에 대해 함께 논의하는 뜻 깊은 시간을 가졌습니다.</span></font></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><font color=\"#222222\" face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br/></span></font></p><div class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"6740\" id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\"></div><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Tahoma, 굴림; font-size: 9pt; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2306/764337996_aa25ddb2_.KakaoTalk_20230630_112616923_16.jpg\" style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"/></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Tahoma, 굴림; font-size: 9pt; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2306/764337996_ffc63aa3_.KakaoTalk_20230630_112616923.jpg\"/><br/><img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2306/764337996_296f0ff6_.KakaoTalk_20230630_112616923_03.jpg\"/></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Tahoma, 굴림; font-size: 9pt; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2306/764337996_453b4fc3_.KakaoTalk_20230630_112616923_05.jpg\"/><br/><img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2306/764337996_e925e2b2_.KakaoTalk_20230630_112616923_17.jpg\"/><br/><img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2306/764337996_d4926d0c_.KakaoTalk_20230630_112616923_07.jpg\"/><br/><img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2306/764337996_0df5460d_.KakaoTalk_20230630_112616923_15.jpg\"/><br/><img align=\"\" src=\"http://data.dimode.co.kr/UserData/prok/data/geditor/2306/764337996_71f83ccd_.KakaoTalk_20230630_112616923_09.jpg\"/></p> <br>\n[이 게시물은 관리자님에 의해 2023-09-26 18:08:18 총회장 동정에서 이동 됨]\r\n\r\n\r\n        </br></div>"
