    "url": "https://www.prok.org/Board/Detail/1672/155750?page=2",
    "content": "<div class=\"detail-content\">\n<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-bdf3e29d-7fff-a2e6-c229-d9d759c71364\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font size=\"3\">제41회 전국장로대회</font></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><font size=\"3\"> </font></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font size=\"3\">‘하나님 나라가 이땅에 이루어지게 하소서’라는 주제로 7월 19일(화) 오후 3시부터 21일(목)까지 속초 소노킴델피노에서 열린 제41회 전국장로대회에 총회장님 참석하시어 개회예배 말씀을 선포해 주셨습니다.</font></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><font size=\"3\"> </font></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font size=\"3\">부총회장 이규철 장로님은 축하와 인사의 시간에 격려사를 해 주셨습니다.</font></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font size=\"3\">전국장로대회가  무사히 잘 마치기를 기도합니다.</font></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"> </p><div align=\"left\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left:0pt;\"><table style=\"border:none;border-collapse:collapse;table-layout:fixed;width:451.27559055118115pt\"><colgroup><col/></colgroup><tbody><tr style=\"height:0pt\"><td style=\"border-left:solid #ffffff 1pt;border-right:solid #ffffff 1pt;border-bottom:solid #ffffff 1pt;border-top:solid #ffffff 1pt;vertical-align:top;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"border:none;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:587px;height:440px;\"><img height=\"440\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/BM_khxoFIrvHlCS0kqoBVRUACDdtRRG7YQF8hcaXw-CoMHbyauFLT1HLyYBhqXQam3qNMuV-vJGludVo48dNwMTwDm3qrPw4kdrXceFBULkbCrh1wgW3slsImEAcJR2okVGhD3jp_4mrY567Ng\" style=\"margin-left:0px;margin-top:0px;\" width=\"587\"/></span></span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height:0pt\"><td style=\"border-left:solid #ffffff 1pt;border-right:solid #ffffff 1pt;border-bottom:solid #ffffff 1pt;border-top:solid #ffffff 1pt;vertical-align:top;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"border:none;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:587px;height:783px;\"><img height=\"783\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/N5Shbc4f-OK3KoPrs-4ay_23Hsha9fGBvnn2iF2TodgflZc3nWyOU0ZtokT8AIffnQggrsz6mlQzdd9Lflt2Biyki3d4cXckWjBNEsae_Zm7YOhfxMq1Cjuyl_Srz-NOmJCtCJJ5pPKIaky6DLgwZg\" style=\"margin-left:0px;margin-top:0px;\" width=\"587\"/></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></span> <br/>\n[이 게시물은 관리자님에 의해 2022-09-27 17:00:10 총회장 동정에서 이동 됨]\r\n\r\n\r\n        </div>"
