    "title": "[총회장 동정 76] 한국장로교여성협의회 제39회 정기총회",
    "author": "김은경",
    "date": "2022-05-26",
    "url": "https://www.prok.org/Board/Detail/1672/155699?page=2",
    "content": "<div class=\"detail-content\">\n<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-075645c0-7fff-b614-a736-7424fadaf4d8\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">한국장로교여성협의회 제39회 정기총회</span></p><br/><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span 255);=\"\" 255,=\"\" 34);=\"\" 34,=\"\" background-color:=\"\" baseline;=\"\" color:=\"\" font-variant-east-asian:=\"\" font-variant-numeric:=\"\" gothic\";=\"\" malgun=\"\" normal;=\"\" pre-wrap;\"=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" rgb(34,=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \" vertical-align:=\"\" white-space:=\"\">한국기독교장로회 여신도회와 </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span 255);=\"\" 255,=\"\" 34);=\"\" 34,=\"\" background-color:=\"\" baseline;=\"\" color:=\"\" font-variant-east-asian:=\"\" font-variant-numeric:=\"\" gothic\";=\"\" malgun=\"\" normal;=\"\" pre-wrap;\"=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" rgb(34,=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \" vertical-align:=\"\" white-space:=\"\">대한예수교장로회 총회 여전도회전국연합회, </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span 255);=\"\" 255,=\"\" 34);=\"\" 34,=\"\" background-color:=\"\" baseline;=\"\" color:=\"\" font-variant-east-asian:=\"\" font-variant-numeric:=\"\" gothic\";=\"\" malgun=\"\" normal;=\"\" pre-wrap;\"=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" rgb(34,=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \" vertical-align:=\"\" white-space:=\"\">대한예수교장로회(백석)의 연합기구인 </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span 255);=\"\" 255,=\"\" 34);=\"\" 34,=\"\" background-color:=\"\" baseline;=\"\" color:=\"\" font-variant-east-asian:=\"\" font-variant-numeric:=\"\" gothic\";=\"\" malgun=\"\" normal;=\"\" pre-wrap;\"=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" rgb(34,=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \" vertical-align:=\"\" white-space:=\"\">한국장로교여성협의회 제39회 정기총회가 </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span 255);=\"\" 255,=\"\" 34);=\"\" 34,=\"\" background-color:=\"\" baseline;=\"\" color:=\"\" font-variant-east-asian:=\"\" font-variant-numeric:=\"\" gothic\";=\"\" malgun=\"\" normal;=\"\" pre-wrap;\"=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" rgb(34,=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \" vertical-align:=\"\" white-space:=\"\">26일 오전10시30분 여전도회관 대강당에서 개최되었습니다.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span 255);=\"\" 255,=\"\" 34);=\"\" 34,=\"\" background-color:=\"\" baseline;=\"\" color:=\"\" font-variant-east-asian:=\"\" font-variant-numeric:=\"\" gothic\";=\"\" malgun=\"\" normal;=\"\" pre-wrap;\"=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" rgb(34,=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \" vertical-align:=\"\" white-space:=\"\"> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span 255);=\"\" 255,=\"\" 34);=\"\" 34,=\"\" background-color:=\"\" baseline;=\"\" color:=\"\" font-variant-east-asian:=\"\" font-variant-numeric:=\"\" gothic\";=\"\" malgun=\"\" normal;=\"\" pre-wrap;\"=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" rgb(34,=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \" vertical-align:=\"\" white-space:=\"\">이날 개회예배에 김은경 총회장님이 참석하여 말씀을 선포하셨습니다.</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> </span></p><br/><div align=\"left\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left:0pt;\"><table style=\"border:none;border-collapse:collapse;table-layout:fixed;width:451.27559055118115pt\"><colgroup><col/></colgroup><tbody><tr style=\"height:0pt\"><td style=\"border-left:solid #ffffff 1pt;border-right:solid #ffffff 1pt;border-bottom:solid #ffffff 1pt;border-top:solid #ffffff 1pt;vertical-align:top;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"border:none;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:587px;height:264px;\"><img height=\"264\" src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/5JDuFvdkqQ1jRnzNW-363fhjMAiLAgNKbK4f5ZP-2T4Jj2ms3nZRZxN7neLgNO8Th26Sq4tTmXYfH1lwEjTbPZOYsj90c3x2nAk3HkXB7uGwyncMtaRr_Zhu22_8EM-i5KzGgzwzrpdvoeAGXQ\" style=\"margin-left:0px;margin-top:0px;\" width=\"587\"/></span></span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height:0pt\"><td style=\"border-left:solid #ffffff 1pt;border-right:solid #ffffff 1pt;border-bottom:solid #ffffff 1pt;border-top:solid #ffffff 1pt;vertical-align:top;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"border:none;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:587px;height:264px;\"><img height=\"264\" src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/ssvZvMNJB4cIDAPnHCNH-B6x1b0muxZz0_caXQ70vLzhTDrq1EYP6I-vVzEQHspY9I89BP9jrA_PmCtBPAgkobMga1ZgleYt3TmtR0MDMOCnV5KacBMEItWEElK5TdkoeRpYGBK4pMAwyVdJaQ\" style=\"margin-left:0px;margin-top:0px;\" width=\"587\"/></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><br/></span> <br>\n[이 게시물은 관리자님에 의해 2022-09-27 17:00:10 총회장 동정에서 이동 됨]\r\n\r\n\r\n        </br></div>"
