    "content": "<div class=\"detail-content\">\n<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-dfc8e26e-7fff-4b67-1ace-ffc2ea750257\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Batang; font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap;\">제106회 총회 임원회</span></b></p></span><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-0d0372c1-7fff-d6b7-52db-411f9883418f\"><br/><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Batang; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">2022년 5월 16-17일, 목포에서</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Batang; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">제106회 총회 임원회 5차 회의가 있었습니다. </span></p><br/><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Batang; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">실행위원회 안건과 제107회 총회, wcc총회 준비 등을 의논하였습니다.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> </span></p><div align=\"left\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left:0pt;\"><table style=\"border:none;border-collapse:collapse;table-layout:fixed;width:354.8976377952756pt\"><colgroup><col/></colgroup><tbody><tr style=\"height:0pt\"><td style=\"border-left:solid #ffffff 1pt;border-right:solid #ffffff 1pt;border-bottom:solid #ffffff 1pt;border-top:solid #ffffff 1pt;vertical-align:top;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"border:none;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:458px;height:344px;\"><img height=\"344\" src=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/WOToa6zFxHQsByWop4KayjzysPzJNKQGzYpHQ2JvADAjnvvDMJ3f5H_GLUYSK0ucdAx8Kl6FXEk5FYoovAIDcYbg7-Bd6_1ZP4QzXAwW_42o69eIUHyr2MEedZGSMstlPbPz5HcF-a5L2uVX8Q\" style=\"margin-left:0px;margin-top:0px;\" width=\"458\"/></span></span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height:0pt\"><td style=\"border-left:solid #ffffff 1pt;border-right:solid #ffffff 1pt;border-bottom:solid #ffffff 1pt;border-top:solid #ffffff 1pt;vertical-align:top;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"border:none;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:458px;height:344px;\"><img height=\"344\" src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/F7PPeQp7K73rM1iLhUh4qw_-22ihDKa14C9wghw-eBa-PO_Rh8AGercZsvhDrMmUJcC_EQfaM2roIfpo3htRHZFHaPJLNpQbA5zCCEoxA1v-GtAc5sDODIdiizflgpzaFybO9cXRngwQl1vAcg\" style=\"margin-left:0px;margin-top:0px;\" width=\"458\"/></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><br/></span> <br>\n[이 게시물은 관리자님에 의해 2022-09-27 17:00:10 총회장 동정에서 이동 됨]\r\n\r\n\r\n        </br></div>"
