    "content": "<div class=\"detail-content\">\n<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-56fabfcc-7fff-1bed-3b66-5d95f8d6e271\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Batang\" size=\"3\" style=\"\"><b style=\"\">증경 총회장단 수련회</b></font></span></p><font face=\"Batang\" size=\"3\"><br/></font><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Batang\" size=\"3\">2022년 5월 9일부터 10일까지 청주제일교회에서 </font></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Batang\" size=\"3\">증경 총회장단 수련회를 열었습니다. </font></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Batang\" size=\"3\">22분의 증경 총회장님들과 사모님들께서 참석하셨습니다. </font></span></p><font face=\"Batang\" size=\"3\"><br/></font><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Batang\" size=\"3\" style=\"\">초청하여 주신 이건희 목사님과 청주제일교회에 감사드립니다.</font></span></p><br/><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"border:none;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:602px;height:451px;\"><img height=\"451\" src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/Cc_QYBtoneRm1Kq6UFQSf5YFf7SpyYWk5F6d5805_UXLLWDgWteWsrSyVZVzoxOXVSnyBZR5QENsA2lgd_pwgUPd2w7dTKw7wZy37PwU-1VOx8TXVp9hPbKqEXzJ2BSw0wfFM_ZRY_2_9cxgvg\" style=\"margin-left:0px;margin-top:0px;\" width=\"602\"/></span></span></p><br/></span> <br>\n[이 게시물은 관리자님에 의해 2022-09-27 17:00:10 총회장 동정에서 이동 됨]\r\n\r\n\r\n        </br></div>"
